      "id": "at-glance",
      "title": "At a glance",
      "body": "Mấy giờ? answers the traveler question \"What time\" in times, dates, tickets, waits, and bookings. This is for when you already both know what the event is and you just need the time. This is the safest time question because the thing itself can be pointed to or named separately. Its job is giving the other person a simple anchor rather than a long explanation. Expect a short reply, a smile, a time, or a light follow-up question; then use Explore next if the reply creates another small task.",
